		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Rainbow-scaled, serpentine sorcerers of Limbo. Draconic, sinuous, 30 feet long, energetic crown perched atop its head.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +3 (1d8) or acid cloud, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Cloud</strong>. Three or more naunets can create a near- size cloud of yellow acid centered on a naunet. It lasts for 5 rounds and spreads around corners. Creatures in cloud are blinded, 2d6 damage on their turns.</p><p></p><p><strong>Being of Chaos</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. Immune to acid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
